/**
 * @mainpage CPSTL
 *
 * CPSTL provides the familiar C++ standard-library vocabulary on hosted and
 * freestanding targets. The public namespace is `cpstd`: in STL mode every
 * name aliases `std`; otherwise CPSTL supplies a C++11-compatible
 * implementation built only on freestanding C headers.
 *
 * @section CPSTL_Start Start here
 * - @ref CPSTL_Configuration selects STL mode, allocation and modules.
 * - @ref CPSTL_Runtime defines allocation and failure behavior.
 * - @ref CPSTL_Modules lists the public vocabulary and headers.
 * - @ref CPSTL_Build documents desktop, AVR and Arduino validation.
 */
